{"title":"Google Drive file picker","description":"Let users open files from Google Drive in Stirling PDF by connecting a Google Cloud project to your server.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>Google Drive file picker</h1>\n<p>Let users pick files from their Google Drive when opening files in Stirling PDF. It works on every plan.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-set-up-google-cloud\" class=\"anchor-heading\">1. Set up Google Cloud<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#1-set-up-google-cloud\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ol>\n<li>Create or choose a Google Cloud project, following <strong>Setting up your environment</strong> in Google's <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/workspace/drive/picker/guides/overview#setup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Picker API guide</a>.</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Credentials</a>, select <strong>Create credentials → OAuth client ID</strong>. Add your Stirling PDF address (for example <code>https://pdf.example.com</code>) to the client's <strong>Authorized JavaScript origins</strong>.</li>\n<li>In the same place, select <strong>Create credentials → API key</strong>.</li>\n<li>Note your project number from <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/settings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IAM &amp; Admin settings</a>. This is the app ID.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"2-configure-stirling-pdf\" class=\"anchor-heading\">2. Configure Stirling PDF<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#2-configure-stirling-pdf\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Enter the values in <strong>Settings → Server → Integrations → Google Drive</strong>, or in <code>settings.yml</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"config-methods\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-0\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"settings\" aria-selected=\"true\">Settings File</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"env\" aria-selected=\"false\">Environment Variable</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"settings\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">premium</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  proFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    googleDrive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      clientId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;client-id></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # the OAuth client ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      apiKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;api-key></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # the API key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      appId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;app-id></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # the project number</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"env\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_PROFEATURES_GOOGLEDRIVE_ENABLED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_PROFEATURES_GOOGLEDRIVE_CLIENTID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">client-id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_PROFEATURES_GOOGLEDRIVE_APIKEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PREMIUM_PROFEATURES_GOOGLEDRIVE_APPID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Server/Storage/Google-Drive.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#1-set-up-google-cloud\">1. Set up Google Cloud</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#2-configure-stirling-pdf\">2. Configure Stirling PDF</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Server/Storage/Folder-Scanning/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Folder scanning</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Server/Automation/MCP-Server/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">MCP server</span>\n      </a>"}